    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">1.1 # of countries with data-informed  development and investment plans that incorporate integrated solutions to reduce disaster risks and enable climate change adaptation
1.2 # of systems supported  to track public expenditures for DRR and climate adaptation supported (disaggregated by country)
1.3 # of UNDP COs and UNCTs supported to integrate DRR in their strategic documents 
1.4 # of countries supported with harmonized policies, legal frameworks, and more integrated institutional arrangements for DRR, CCA and development
