1.6 # of local governments, municipalities and communities supported in implementing gender-responsive risk reduction measures (aggregated by country).
1.7 # of government and non-government officials trained in DRR/CCA in fragile contexts (disaggregated by country and sex)
1.8 # of global and regional policy guidance and tools launched in support of integrated risk governance</narrative>
    </description>
